{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917", "id": 531871235, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWU1MzE4NzEyMzU=", "number": 917, "title": "MAVSDK - setup_udp_remote - no MAVLink being received using Passthrough", "user": {"login": "VarkAven", "id": 5263844, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUyNjM4NDQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5263844?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven", "html_url": "https://github.com/VarkAven", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/VarkAven/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2019-12-03T10:12:40Z", "updated_at": "2020-11-20T12:05:50Z", "closed_at": "2020-11-20T12:05:50Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nI have tried to connect to QGC to send/receive MAVLink messages using _MAVSDK 0.21.3_ setup_udp_remote, utilizing MavlinkPassthrough plugin. It seems like connection created this way is not able to receive MAVLink messages.\r\n\r\nI've prepared a demonstration application to show just that:\r\n\r\n**Demonstration:**\r\n\r\n1. Clone https://github.com/VarkAven/mavsdk_udp_issue \r\n2. Build it using standard cmake build (make build directory, source CMakeLists.txt etc...) (Make sure you have _MAVSDK 0.21.3_ installed on your system)\r\n3 Launch QGC (3.5.5), _set it up to receive UDP connections_ (QGC -> General -> check UDP field in \"AutoConnect to the following devices\")\r\n4. Launch the demo application, **no arguments required**.\r\n5. Observe that **\"Received PING response!\"** **does not appear.** Neither **\"Received MAVLink message. It's msgid:\"** despite being subscribed and having a callback to receive every MAVLink message.\r\n\r\n**Some more information:**\r\n\r\nConnecting to QGC via bare Linux API UDP socket and sending MAVLink Ping request yields QGC responding with Ping response MAVLink message. So QGC has Ping micro service implemented.\r\n\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/561116127", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917#issuecomment-561116127", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917", "id": 561116127, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2MTExNjEyNw==", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-03T11:00:07Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-10T22:04:14Z", "body": "I recently wrote a small test module connecting to QGC from MAVSDK, pretending to be an autopilot. I found a few issues in MAVSDK, that I patched [here](https://github.com/Auterion/fake_autopilot/blob/master/mavsdk.patch).\r\n\r\nMore specifically, MAVSDK ignores messages coming from QGC...\r\n\r\n1. ... in [receive_message()](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/develop/src/core/mavsdk_impl.cpp#L78-L84):\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n    // FIXME: Ignore messages from QGroundControl for now. Usually QGC identifies\r\n    //        itself with sysid 255.\r\n    //        A better way would probably be to parse the heartbeat message and\r\n    //        look at type and check if it is MAV_TYPE_GCS.\r\n    if (message.sysid == 255) {\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\n2. ... in [receive()](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/develop/src/core/udp_connection.cpp#L245-L246):\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n    // FIXME: We ignore messages from QGC (255) for now.\r\n    if (!saved_remote && sysid != 0 && sysid != 255) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso, my patch adds an `Autopilot` configuration, but I'm not sure if you need that.\r\n\r\nCould you try removing those filters in MAVSDK and let us know if that helps? Then I am not completely sure how to fix that properly: should a GCS always ignore other GCS? What about a companion? Or more specifically, when should a MAVLink system ignore another one?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/561116127/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/731131563", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917#issuecomment-731131563", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917", "id": 731131563, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDczMTEzMTU2Mw==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2020-11-20T12:05:50Z", "updated_at": "2020-11-20T12:05:50Z", "body": "There was no response in a long time, closing.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/731131563/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}], "timeline": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/561116127", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/917#issuecomment-561116127", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/r